{"id":"n70268-1-34","stage":3,"title":"원인 · 原因","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70268-1-34-1","ko":"자꾸 컴퓨터가 멈추는 이유가 뭔가요?","zh":"电脑老是死机，原因是什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터가","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터가","audio":"/audio/030aed3df715066144e8.mp3"}},{"text":"멈추는","meaning":"停","explanation":"멈추다：停；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"3","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈추는","audio":"/audio/662e6a03631ff2f32589.mp3"}},{"text":"이유가","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유가","audio":"/audio/31a72eab8830677dbc1a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭔가요?","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔가요","audio":"/audio/204052bc4781b20a6c30.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"eaee887b30c38d73","term":"멈추다","zh":"停","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3","entryId":"46133","definition":"不再动了。","pronunciation":["멈추다"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/418822df3e0908d0ec03.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70268-1-34-2","ko":"아무래도 바이러스가 원인인 것 같습니다.","zh":"看来是病毒造成的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是。","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"바이러스가","meaning":"病毒，电脑病毒","explanation":"바이러스：病毒，电脑病毒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바이러스","audio":"/audio/38b5772e1520b3dded97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15813","senseId":"2","lemma":"바이러스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바이러스가","audio":"/audio/9329651f7636bd0d8844.mp3"}},{"text":"원인인","meaning":"原因，理由，缘由","explanation":"원인：原因，理由，缘由；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"원인","audio":"/audio/b84254868f623d278671.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70268","senseId":"1","lemma":"원인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원인인","audio":"/audio/65a1d07ed4f07dab5015.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma"